From 6abbfb563d28c7c3bfab9bd4d259b3680015a33b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:42:09 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 099/144] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy: Add
 Kaanapali CSI2 PHY

Add "qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy" as a standalone compatible. Its common
status register offset differs from x1e80100, so it cannot fall back
to that compatible.

Reviewed-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261102-kaanapali-camss-v24-1-d6b8f3f6f66f@oss.qualcomm.com

Import-Patch: pkgs/linux-kernel/sm8750/dodge/patches/7.3/0131-dt-bindings-phy-qcom-x1e80100-csi2-phy-Add-Kaanapali.patch
Import-SHA256: 66bfadb9ac7b3e98eabc0f1b53b455fdccbd4a276d8ba0ea3d94778ef6e8d800
